          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of silent movement of bright points in the night sky; festive evening of the Tour de France: probable observation of fantasy balloons.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "0b76e8bb825b4cf51676b0a785c42a69dda0fbf3ce781c515381c83c41a04f7e"
